# Directories used by the stock GNSS HAL (gnss_service, user gps). Stock
# creates them in loc-launcher.rc and init.qcom.rc, which are not installed.
# The HAL keeps small AP-side state files in /data/vendor/location (gps.prop,
# energy.conf; libgps.utils and libgnss path strings) and serves its local IPC
# socket in /dev/socket/location. The engine's own state lives in the modem
# and its remote file system on persist, not here. Directories for
# loc_launcher's daemons (mq, xtwifi, hmac, xtra, ehub, dgnss, qsap_location,
# location-partner) are not created because those daemons are not installed.
on post-fs-data
    mkdir /data/vendor/location 0770 gps gps
    mkdir /dev/socket/location 0770 gps gps
